WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.000
Oh, no, Asoko!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.770
Magical Girl Asoko Ace Triple Dash will be broadcast!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.240
Finally Asoko will be aired.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.480
I can meet the new you.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.280
Magical Girl Asoko ATD
Broadcast Confirmed!!
Asoko!

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.840
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:51.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:08.260
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:21.940
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:29.650
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:34.490
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.230
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:41.500
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:47.240
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:51.510
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:54.810
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:01:54.810 --> 00:02:01.020
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.960
Mammoth Trouble!

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.830
Give it up, Sekidousai.
There's nowhere for you to run.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.700
What am I supposed to give up?

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.570
As expected of Karina's ancestor.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.240
I'm not a pervert.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.940
Huh, indeed.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:26.410
But why is a great mage like you looking like that?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.680
Then I'll ask you in return.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.680
What's wrong with this look?

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:31.950
What?

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:36.190
Why can't someone expose their nether region?

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.220
And yet why are monkeys naked?

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.760
Because they're monkeys.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.660
Why can't men be naked like monkeys?

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:48.730
Why must we wear clothing?

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:52.270
Don't you have any ethics as a human?

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:57.210
Ethics, morals, human ways.
What a joke.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.280
Is something that binds you called wisdom?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.840
I'll say this again.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.150
Humans are free beings.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.020
I will make a world,

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:11.190
where all desires are affirmed and all wishes are granted.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.660
That's enough.
There's no more need for talk.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.090
So it seems.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.760
- Yeah.
- Right.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:23.970
Okay, Master.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.800
Incompetent descendant.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.740
You again?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.610
In the name of the wise Hakusan.
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.750
In the name of Tousan Shinkun.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.580
Sing upon a symphony.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.190
Evil Blaze.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.670
Darn you!

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:04.670
Wait.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.710
Keita, calm down.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.550
We should attack together.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.280
Kaoru's right.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.980
All right. A 3-way attack.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.020
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.890
In the name of Tousan Shinkun.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.460
Evil Blaze!
- Sing upon a symphony!
- Crush your enemy!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.670
Master Kaoru.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:39.240
This is...

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.980
How dare you hurt Master Kaoru.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:47.050
What's wrong? Is that all you've got?

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:47.950
Nadeshiko.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.690
Understood.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.290
Get ready, Sekidousai.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:59.300
You have to entertain me more.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.800
I hate that attitude of yours.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.300
In the name of the wise Hakusan. Frog...

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.200
In the name of
Tousan Shinkun. Atmosphere...

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.340
Huh, what?

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.610
- Crush.
- Sing upon a symphony.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:15.680
What? Oh no.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.420
Not fair. You left me out.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.790
- One more.
- Got it.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.360
Evil Blaze.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.260
Oh my?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.260
Where is this?

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.330
Sekidousai's secret base, or something like that.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:36.330
What's going on?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:41.700
While we were attacking Sekidousai, the space was recovering.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:47.680
He acted like he was being attacked, but he was absorbing our power.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.480
So we attacked the source.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.750
I see. You're so smart, Keita.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.080
Well done for seeing through that.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.620
I'll praise you.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.320
Hey, let me out.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.390
What are you doing?

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:08.760
I'll directly absorb all of their power and turn it into mine.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.330
Stop it. Release them.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.070
I shall be your opponent.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.900
Holy Crush.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.840
Don't get in my way!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.410
Let's play.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.810
Incompetent descendant.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.150
- Geez, Keita.
- No, this is...

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.960
Oh. A comrade.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.860
No. That's not what you think it is.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.130
Stop.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.300
Don't. Oh, no.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.340
That's... No.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.980
Warning.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.880
Spiritual power input is spiking.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.810
At this rate, it will break.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.990
Impossible. It's just two
Inukami Users and their dogs.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.620
Stop it. Don't look.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.130
Don't look!

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.830
You're unbelievable.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:19.130
Nope. Really sorry, but I'll turn the system to emergency shutdown.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.640
90%... 80%... 70%...

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.510
Darn... Ouch.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:28.510
Is there nothing but that kind of stuff in your head?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.010
This isn't the time to ask that.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.780
I have good news, pure-hearted lady.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.090
My other goal in reviving myself...

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.860
That is to take revenge on Dai Yoko.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.720
Revenge on Dad?

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:46.230
I once fought Dai Yoko, and suffered defeat.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.530
I have been in recluse here since.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.200
I kept waiting for my revival.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:56.910
Thanks to you, I now have enough power to return to Earth.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.210
I'll gather the rest on Earth.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.880
I won't let you.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.380
You play here.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.510
- Darn.
- There.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.720
There.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.050
Evil Fire.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.320
Wow, fire.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.090
Kawahira.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:18.690
Keita.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:21.200
Incompetent descendant, round 2.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.470
- There, there, there.
- No more!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.700
Are you okay?

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.470
Yeah, sorry.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.610
The time has come.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.240
The first step to Sekidousai's dream.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.410
Are you going?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.210
That's right. It's time for revival.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.520
We're off.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.220
Wait!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.430
He's gone?

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.200
Keita, that's...

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.070
Jump in.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.200
Keita, wait.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.500
We must go too.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.340
Yes.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.040
Let's go back to everyone.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.810
Everyone...

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:13.520
Why didn't you say anything?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.320
I'm sorry.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.790
There's no point in getting angry now.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.920
That's right.
Let's look for Master Kaoru too.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.030
But how do we get inside the picture?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.390
What?

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.500
Be careful.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.530
I feel a strange spiritual power.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:34.070
He's coming.
Master Kaoru is coming back.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.940
Forget the fortune telling.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:41.940
Master Kaoru?

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:44.780
Master Kaoru.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.250
Are you hurt?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.420
Where have you been?

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.450
I'll explain later.
Now is not the time.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.460
It's already started.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.490
Keita.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:00.500
We'll defeat Sekidousai. Let's go.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.700
It smells like cucumber...

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.340
"Inukami!"

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:09.970
Woof woof.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.140
"Inukami!"

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:14.980
Woof woof.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.360
Socrates, how are you doing?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:34.330
Seems like you felt my spiritual power rising.

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:37.170
Daisakkai, how's things going?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:38.900
It's going good, baby.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.600
Right now we're around 80%.
Bit unstable though.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.840
I see.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:47.040
But it sure is a nice thing...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.650
People's happiness.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:55.080
Dreams, hopes, prayers, love.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.090
The feelings of people that seek happiness...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:05.860
gathered together, they make quite an amount.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:11.670
I shall absorb all of them for my spiritual power.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:12.830
Stop it.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.840
Don't use people's happiness for your power.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:21.940
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.080
Frog, blow him up.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.690
It didn't affect him?

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:35.020
It's because I'm regaining my original power.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.260
Socrates, play with them.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.330
Out of the way!

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.900
This kind of thing again?

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.940
Be naked and you're told to clothe.

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:49.070
Clothe them, and they say no.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:52.210
Good grief, clothes are so troublesome.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:55.780
As an exhibitionist, you have no right to say that.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.750
I don't want to be misunderstood, so let me tell you.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:02.050
I'm not naked.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:05.620
I'm wearing clothes called "pride".

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.290
Is that so?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.990
Well, I'm busy increasing my spiritual power.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.830
Your opponent shall be...

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.510
It's huge.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.880
Take good care of them.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.550
Understood, Master.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.320
There!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.150
Master Kaoru.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.120
Too heavy. I can't do it alone.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.660
Are you okay?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.860
Yeah, thanks.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.870
Rotate, rotate.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.400
Tons of holes.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.440
One done.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.670
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x All.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.310
Purgatory!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.550
We did it.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.980
Look.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.820
That was warm.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:10.790
No effect!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.990
Let's retreat for now.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.660
What a tough opponent.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.860
It's heading this way.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.560
Found you.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.260
Let's play.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.460
You're too big, it's cheating.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.500
Double rotation.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.570
Then let's attack its vital spot.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.540
Vital spot?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.470
I don't like it, but...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.980
Destroy.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:34.810
Sing.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:35.980
Evil Fire.

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.250
Did we do it?

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:42.320
It didn't work?

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.120
Keita, look at that.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:44.920
No!

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.160
Xancopter.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:50.930
Be flat.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:56.830
Hey Yoko, take me above him with Teleport.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.100
What are you going to do?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.140
Maybe I can figure out his weakness, so hurry.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.770
Got it, Teleport.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:07.040
Hey, where are you teleporting me?

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.880
Found you.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:12.150
- Stop it.
- Rotate, rotate.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.680
Keita!

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.120
Keita.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.760
Are you okay?

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.660
Yeah...

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:27.130
Darn. What are we supposed to do with that big thing?

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.800
Stomp, stomp.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.900
With that size, I don't think magic or spiritual power would work.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.740
Push up exercise.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.210
So we have to beat it with brute force, huh?

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.480
Where do we find such power?

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:48.050
Pathetic, truly pathetic.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:50.990
You don't understand what happiness is.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.990
That's why you're doing this.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.920
That voice, you can't be?

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.930
Long time no see.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:00.900
Mon amour, Yoko, and beautiful ballerina, Keita Kawahira.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.400
Kawarazaki.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.900
You idiot, what are you doing?

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.640
Ah, leave it to me.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.510
Listen up, those who live in darkness.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.810
Those happy people who live in the bright light have run out of power.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.520
Now, this city is on the verge of death.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.420
But we cannot live in the light.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:30.660
However, we can't ignore what's happening in front of us.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:36.160
Where there's light, there's also darkness.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:42.170
To take the happiness in light is the same as taking our happiness.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.510
This is not unrelated to you.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:52.080
Stand up, comrades. And fight together to protect happiness.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:16:08.330
Protect happiness...

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.470
- Protect happiness...
- Incredible!

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.770
So many of Keita's friends!

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:14.740
What? No.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.870
Who are they?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.010
Are they saying happiness also exists in darkness?

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:27.120
Happiness is not something decided by the amount of light.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:29.920
Everyone, go.

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:45.670
Heave, ho.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:55.980
Incredible.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.850
The giant pervert was beat by perverts.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.080
Now you've done it.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.090
Everybody, die.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.090
That's right.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.160
He's only become bigger.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.360
If that's the case...

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.560
Yoko, Teleport me there again.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.460
- What?
- Just hurry up.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.100
Uh, Teleport.

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.740
I knew it.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.440
He's just bigger, so his seam lines are open.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.540
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.350
Frog, burn up with full power and explode.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:48.100
You're pretty good, Keita Kawahira.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:53.070
You might be fit to be my successor.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.740
He's our pride.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:56.840
What?

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.010
Impossible.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.880
There's a human that can approach me without me realizing?

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.850
Yes, I dwell in the darkness.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.150
How dare you.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.020
Blood of Sekidou.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:16.620
Come.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:20.900
What?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.400
I'm thinking, too.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.430
What are you doing?

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.470
Well then, farewell.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.450
The grimoire.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.020
Hey, that's dangerous.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.210
Keita.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.520
It's around 85% now.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:20.220
Is that so? I guess that's enough for today if we gathered that much.

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:54.720
Thank you, Kawarazaki.

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:58.490
I've traded blows with Keita Kawahira before.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.660
There's no need for gratitude.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.730
All I need is...

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.430
This.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.740
Adieu, Yoko.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.610
Good work, everyone.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.440
Yes, Master Kaoru.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.150
Everyone, are you all right?

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:28.590
But I think I'm forgetting something.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:29.720
Remember...

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:34.500
If you can't remember, it isn't that important.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.230
I guess.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.750
Daisakkai, how's the new house?

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:56.150
My, it's pretty comfortable here.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.250
The magical power pipeline fits nicely too.

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:02.790
You like it too, Socrates?

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:07.600
I'm glad you like it.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:15.040
I'm grateful from the bottom of my heart, great mage.

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:37.360
Man

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:43.200
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:48.500
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:53.640
<i>We try out poses</i> <i>in front of the mirror</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:59.010
<i>Peeping, tying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.820
<i>I know how to cook</i> <i>because I was a chef</i>

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.590
<i>I won't lose to a maid in cleaning</i>

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:07.260
<i>I get a tan at a tanning salon</i>

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.730
<i>But we're not popular</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.300
Unauthorized
Banned from broadcast
<i>We run around naked,</i>

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:20.070
<i>We can't stop because we enjoy it</i>

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We are so manly</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.040
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>When we drink together,</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:33.010
<i>we go on such a rampage</i> <i>that we forget our sadness</i>

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:35.580
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.420
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.960
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:53.940
Inukami!

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:54.970
See you - Sekidousai

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:59.370
I don't even know where this series is going.

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:03.340
It's so unique that creators cannot join even if they wish to.

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:07.920
But from among them, a hero jumps forth.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:11.850
"Please let me write the script."

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:13.960
The novelist, Toshihiko Tsukiji.

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.290
He is also a fine pervert.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:19.330
Next on Maburaho, I mean, Inukami.

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:21.530
As the Erect Keita Planned!

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:24.970
Friends bring friends.
Exactly as planned.
